data: {"id": "61b249ad12c241a0-final", "run_id": "61b249ad12c241a0", "seq": 914, "ts_ms": 1788440070279, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，容器 app 持续重启 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` 状态 `CrashLoopBackOff`，容器 `app` 重启 16 次，最后一次终止原因为 `Error`，退出码 2 | 确认 Pod 处于持续失败且正在尝试重启的异常状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff`：`back-off 5m0s restarting failed container=app`，事件持续 59 分钟内重复 246 次 | 证实重启动作频率极高且系统已触发退避机制 |\n| 3 | Logging | Elasticsearch | 日志模式 `http_request`：`runtime process exiting`，`http_status: 500`，`path: /work`，时间范围 12:32 至 12:47 | 直接显示应用逻辑在处理 `/work` 时抛出 500 错误并导致进程退出 |\n| 4 | Tracing | Deepflow | L7 Flow：GET `/work`，`response_code: 500`，重复 4 次，耗时 4616us 至 6226us | 从网络层视角独立印证了 `/work` 接口返回 500 错误的事实 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 容器资源请求：`cpu: 20m, memory: 24Mi`；限制：`cpu: 200m, memory: 96Mi` | 提供资源基线，结合无 OOMKilled 状态，辅助排除硬内存限制导致的 Crash |\n\n**证据交叉印证**：\nK8s 状态（#1, #2）显示容器非正常退出并频繁重启；Logging（#3）与 Tracing（#4）从应用层和网络层共同指向同一个原因：对 `/work` 路径的请求导致应用内部 500 错误及进程终止。退出码 2 与日志中的 `runtime process exiting` 逻辑一致，进一步区别于 OOMKill (exit code 137)。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n/work 端点代码逻辑错误（未捕获异常） → 返回 HTTP 500 Internal Server Error → 进程以非零退出码 2 强制终止 → 触发 Kubernetes CrashLoopBackOff 及周期性重启\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：应用代码在处理 `/work` 端点时存在逻辑缺陷，导致运行时抛出未处理的内部错误（HTTP 500），进而引发进程异常退出（Exit Code 2）。\n\n**证据支持**：\n1.  **应用错误表现**：Elasticsearch 日志（证据 #3）在崩溃时间窗口内频繁记录 `http_status: 500` 伴随 `runtime process exiting`。\n2.  **网络层验证**：Deepflow 追踪数据（证据 #4）聚合展示了针对同一资源 `/work` 的 4 次 500 响应。\n3.  **容器状态关联**：Kubernetes 报告的状态为 `Error` 且退出码为 `2`（证据 #1, #2），符合业务逻辑崩溃特征，排除了基础设施层面的 OOMKill（通常为 137）或探针失败。\n\n**已知局限**：\n由于日志中 Trace ID 与当前日志批次不一致（未知项提及 `41ea4f...` 与 `5ece3a...` 不匹配），缺乏精确对应单次崩溃堆栈的详细 Trace 数据，且 Metrics 维度缺失，未能提供内存趋势佐证（尽管 Exit Code 2 已强烈暗示非 OOM）。当前证据链已足以定位根因为应用代码层面的 `/work` 端点处理错误。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 96.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c: 96.7s (Evidence 86.6s, RCA 9.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 128.625, "metrics": {"run_id": "61b249ad12c241a0", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 128.63008666038513, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 128630.08666038513, "llm_calls": 20, "llm_duration_ms": 123607.50365257263, "tool_calls": 28, "executed_tool_calls": 16, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 11, "successful_tool_calls": 26, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 10880.836009979248, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4374.976396560669}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19054.264307022095, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 96661.87953948975, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12890.869855880737, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

